Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你去冷凍吧  尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,誰啊？又出現新的人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.97,0:00:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你一副啞口無言的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼企圖嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那也是「那個」的意志嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,意志？那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你醒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如何？用速成學習有比較理解了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,想摸魚嗎？我可不允許那種行為喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,夕里子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是近光速船艦的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.78,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
